# MASP Parameter Files Directory
#
# Download the following files and place them here:
#
# 1. masp-spend.params (~49.8 MB):
#    https://github.com/anoma/masp-mpc/releases/download/namada-trusted-setup/masp-spend.params
#
# 2. masp-output.params (~16.4 MB):
#    https://github.com/anoma/masp-mpc/releases/download/namada-trusted-setup/masp-output.params
#
# You can download them with:
#   curl -L -o masp-spend.params https://github.com/anoma/masp-mpc/releases/download/namada-trusted-setup/masp-spend.params
#   curl -L -o masp-output.params https://github.com/anoma/masp-mpc/releases/download/namada-trusted-setup/masp-output.params
